<title>USA: Proffitt's Inc sells $125 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's Inc sells $125 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement of high-yield bonds from Proffitt's Inc was priced on Thursday via lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The company operates a chain of regional department stores.</p>
<p>BORROWER PROFFITT'S INC</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 8 1/8 PCT  MATURITY 5/15/04</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.427  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA2   YIELD 8.234 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD +162.5 BPS CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1662))</p>
</text>
